{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "6948a52c747a6c75361ee4b7700e82644a09b1179dc35bbf12f60bfdc9e7e7f7", "ja": "これからの女優たち", "zh": "女演员们的将来", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f79bf12a403af7ef2ae07ca6f63659f4b8ff9669d1600603e5e3d1927fd8c149", "ja": "『屋根裏の道化師』がクランクアップし、\n打ち上げもかねて観劇に向かうアイドル達。\nホラーな内容に若干怯えつつも、お芝居の\n魅力を再確認する。そして、これからも\n色々演じてみたいと語り合うのだった。", "zh": "《阁楼里的小丑》杀青了，\n偶像们前去观赏舞台剧，当作是庆祝。\n众人虽然对舞台剧恐怖的内容有些害怕，\n却也同时再次体认到戏剧的魅力。\n然后，她们谈论往后要尝试更多不同角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "be3518e4aeb2031b9e1547ecffa39a2aed864fe0f338345a3e1291c856aea34c", "ja": "（『屋根裏の道化師』は無事、クランクアップした！\nみんなが頑張った事もあり、いい映画になりそうだ）", "zh": "（《阁楼里的小丑》顺利杀青了！\n大家都付出许多努力，想必会是一部好电影。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dae8bd0cb3ab2dde8a62ac4b82de94fba6414ff6ad55ff1a9c9af06c99e947af", "ja": "（今日は、今回の仕事で舞台に興味を持ったみんなと、\n打ち上げをかねて観劇に来たんだけど……）", "zh": "（今天和因这次工作而对舞台剧产生兴趣的成员们\n来观赏舞台剧，顺便庆祝杀青……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5c3c75c30cf77d9968ed419479601060f517701729cea02d40a10ebea0253c0b", "ja": "？　……『戦慄のマッドドクター』？\nいったい、どのようなお話なのでしょうか……？", "zh": "嗯？……《战栗的疯狂医生》？\n这到底在讲怎么样的故事呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "5ef95939ced0cc6c97e1a1fe2a6185b9d82b9b5194a9937da45964b33073864b", "ja": "小鳥ちゃんに、おすすめされたのよね。\nホラーサスペンスらしいけど……。", "zh": "是小鸟推荐我们来看的吧？\n好像是恐怖悬疑的故事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "da4e1dd84b28476da69d6a21f89d967889a0bd28fce69c73e94a91ef1ad7801b", "ja": "とても恐ろしいシーンがあると、\n口コミなどで話題になっているようです。", "zh": "听说这出戏有非常恐怖的桥段，\n引发了很多热烈讨论。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "c21a510c6f2cb476abc217fe806743db6a566ee1176ca4b8acfa6d3dc67aa141", "ja": "ふーん。ま、子供だましじゃなきゃいいけど。", "zh": "是喔──不错啊，希望不要只是骗小孩的把戏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "03c688b635829f6415fa8b228dcc2eeffa260e477e90b15bf67a15b0ed616d14", "ja": "あっ……そろそろはじまるみたいだよ。", "zh": "啊……好像要开演啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1008_p", "source_sha256": "09817a1dcf695f0f14f83e9f472feb9ac34d040668b241cd8bc1f09c6b934778", "ja": "（そして、第一幕が終わった……）", "zh": "（然后，第一幕结束了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "47f13f3fadaed9e96eae3f6ca2f63413dfa05d526dda10f9eac16a5e656d8056", "ja": "ま、ままま、まあまあ怖かったわね！", "zh": "这、这这这、这还挺可怕的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d73d7c3de6a7f44eb2b5295c6d544b9ad6924cf7e698ec9a7225fb262bdac437", "ja": "このみさん、ヒザがガクガクしてますよ……。\nキツいなら外に出ましょうか？", "zh": "木实，你的脚在发抖喔……\n不敢看的话，我们就先离场吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "b38b67724e7103f2a1a65174f6f9e85c87b2be28cac2b77bced2a00513506d84", "ja": "な、な、なーに言ってるのよ！\nもういい大人なんだから、今さらお芝居くらいで……！", "zh": "你、你、你在说什么！？\n我都几岁了，怎么可能会被一出戏吓到……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "e2324734d65206dd213889b56cb902f165d7fa51d5efe86b8a45f008d4a13508", "ja": "……私は、とても怖かったです。マッドドクター、\n夢に出てくるかもしれません。……プルプル。", "zh": "……我觉得非常恐怖。\n晚上说不定会梦到疯狂医生……（瑟瑟发抖）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "860f965fbf4a70de23d8633145990056a342a1bf663d101d4adcd174ebcb511f", "ja": "っ……{$P$}！！", "zh": "……{$P$}！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1016_p", "source_sha256": "1b12ed482c7473521c395d1d9689ffaad062473cf8bc34087757294516f4b649", "ja": "ど、どうした、紬！？", "zh": "怎、怎么了？䌷！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e2d27d1c3efd3d1ad9a0da585878948891982992716e4d70b4298976e6d51845", "ja": "これはいったいなんですか！　打ち上げなどと言いな\nがら、私達にこれほど恐ろしい思いをさせるなんて！", "zh": "这到底是怎么一回事！？你说要来庆祝杀青，\n却让我们留下如此恐怖的回忆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4dbb49a8f4164639afcfe36fdfff248cf07d80535adab4b10625d556a0e911d7", "ja": "もしや、貴方こそがマッドドクターなのですか！？\n人を弄ばずにはいられないほど歪んでいるのですか！？", "zh": "该不会，你才是疯狂医生吧！？\n性格扭曲到忍不住玩弄他人取乐吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7c6057297214fce8a494e24100b1412cd062fe39cb3c1710bd81111e37143853", "ja": "ち、違う、誤解だ！　俺だって怖かったよ！", "zh": "不、不是，你误会了！我自己也看得很害怕啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "23c05c98cba0b19c5928b44c803c0366548570d46f26e2e3b71cbb5d71594d08", "ja": "桃子ちゃん……大丈夫？", "zh": "桃子……你还好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1022_049mom", "source_sha256": "7f7e4c2b382f83dbcfaa709e17da0f9e996c892736205c547b1a86776bef8232", "ja": "えっ？　……と、当然だよ。\nあーあ、やっぱり子供だましだったね！", "zh": "咦？当、当然没问题啰。\n唉，果然只是骗小孩子的把戏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "50a0b1393032ec111b0d0e0d9e6d036a8f106366fae929a9c29f19d20b8d4062", "ja": "そうなんだ……桃子ちゃんはすごいね。\nでも私は、ちょっと怖かったかな……。", "zh": "这样啊……桃子好勇敢喔。\n不过我倒是有点害怕呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "5a6e72707807e9d2ba3368130455f474f4c31dcec2d7d3ed0ba5b785243e648a", "ja": "ふ、ふうん……そうなんだ。\nじゃあ桃子が、手を握っててあげようか？", "zh": "是、是喔……这样啊。\n不然桃子握着你的手吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "064febf5641cfed41738ced4ef34e2643cc9e49e8b0dfb6823a95718ba9aec8e", "ja": "じゃあ、お願いしようかな。\n……ふふ。ありがとう、桃子ちゃん。", "zh": "好，那就麻烦你吧。\n……呵呵，谢谢你，桃子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "34ff67802ed0b4515720611d1cd099dbd08cfb11285c46c4c6d781859762cce8", "ja": "琴葉さんもみんなも、大人なのに怖がりだね。\nほんと、しょうがないんだから……。", "zh": "琴叶姊和大家都不小了，居然还这么胆小。\n真是拿你们没办法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "905b8ae2f813d6b300c3612b20684af254bbde26fc295cece1e053b7f3f5e669", "ja": "う～ん、面白かったわね！\nまさか、結末があんなことになるなんて……。", "zh": "嗯～好好看喔！\n没想到结局会是那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "7cb0f828164012ce871f84fa829de2bd72780cbc3c952d99fe3e68b92eda4d86", "ja": "真相を知ってから本を読み返すと、また、\n違った発見ができそうです。……二度おいしい。", "zh": "知道真相后再去看一次小说，\n应该又会有其他发现……一鱼两吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "473b6fd7adb4ad059dd144423308874942cddcad360621ebf0584bd621af5d12", "ja": "舞台も、映画も、そうですが……\nお芝居というのは、不思議なものですね。", "zh": "舞台剧与电影都是如此……\n戏剧真是奇妙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1031_051tmg", "source_sha256": "58be77e3324dd15731ae81ba6a85737b5ad2366f8405a3faac610663f1bdbbc4", "ja": "七尾さんが言っていました。普段の自分と\n違うことができるから、お芝居は楽しいのだと。", "zh": "七尾也说过「能有不同于平时的体验」，\n所以戏剧才会这么有趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1032_044miz", "source_sha256": "932740b41ce7168310bb419f2da332493c21a09aabdb7dd5ff97033091ea1d00", "ja": "はい。私も、今回のお仕事で、同じことを感じました。\n同時に、すこし不安も感じました。", "zh": "是的，我在这次工作中也有了相同体会。\n同时，也感到一丝不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1033_044miz", "source_sha256": "436cd9b65fbfdf4dc09787b2c65f3a5cd0704d612cf59d2aecb214dd48e421e4", "ja": "いつもの私とは違う私を、みんなは……\n特にファンの人たちは、どう受け止めるんだろう、と。", "zh": "对于不同于平时的自己，大家……\n尤其是粉丝们会如何看待呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1034_p", "source_sha256": "731db1048e1d3460339eec0a401652e54c9e684dad543d531f0e3ca57ad5d0e8", "ja": "うん……そうだな。でも、だからこそ……\nみんな、お芝居を見たいのかもしれないな。", "zh": "嗯……好问题。不过，也许正因为如此……\n大家才会来观赏戏剧吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1035_039kon", "source_sha256": "d67e09e75cedea8ef100b1d990d6e44f7c76f5eb8a9356db1b7796d114bd4508", "ja": "私たちのいる現実と、映画の中の私たち……\n同じ人なのに、まったく違って見えるんだものね。", "zh": "我们所在的现实世界，以及电影中的我们……\n都是同样的人，却有截然不同的印象呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1036_051tmg", "source_sha256": "afa711912473429c80b78a431b76063fd92b7016aca1eb9e9d2baa347e3d1adc", "ja": "はい。その場所に身を置くというのは、\n緊張しますけれど……。", "zh": "是的，而置身于那样的场景，\n虽然令人紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1037_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d231289ea78d3e39246e2387cc4af80f28b1ae10abc73d020296e5c03fdcc290", "ja": "でも、とても……とても、楽しいことですね。", "zh": "但是，也非常……非常地开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1038_017kth", "source_sha256": "90b5a4c43a14ca6750d74e1dc73ffba9ecaa01fd90b390244deb8d9265bf70b7", "ja": "そうだね。私も、演劇のそんなところが好き。\n紬ちゃんがお芝居を好きになってくれて、うれしいな。", "zh": "没错，我也很喜欢演戏的这个部分。\n看到小䌷喜欢上演戏，我也很开心喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1039_049mom", "source_sha256": "8e40552d26317e5ad73433b5e96690065af890e85cb430497d5cbf3efea74198", "ja": "うん、そうだね。\n桃子も、ライバルが増えるのは大歓迎だよ！", "zh": "嗯，对啊。\n桃子也很欢迎对手继续增加喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1040_039kon", "source_sha256": "e0d1fd45ebe4ee68569c23d2ab298705d1503bc45c08e0a944c2c0f778648530", "ja": "機会があったら、またこのメンバーで\nお芝居がしたいわよね。", "zh": "下次还有机会的话，\n我们这班人马再来演一次戏吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1041_044miz", "source_sha256": "0dcda10383036ab13d8c3d6dcab6c04018a7db87e2bf2d5f70940cbd2026047e", "ja": "今度は、お客さんをたくさん笑わせる役も\nやってみたいです。……練習、するぞ。", "zh": "下次我想要尝试演出逗得观众哈哈大笑的角色……\n我要开始练习啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1042_039kon", "source_sha256": "eb5d71e39462a6c169dca03a8b9b292e307f1fca7fe6147a20d2dbe95b71e78a", "ja": "私はやっぱり、次も……\nアダルティな魅力をいかせる役がいいわね！", "zh": "下一次，我还是一样……\n想演出发挥我成熟魅力的角色！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1043_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b8de03216eb5651e85460d6a005588fd60483ca41c01835556b47face3c01166", "ja": "わ、私は……ええと……。", "zh": "我、我的话……呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1044_017kth", "source_sha256": "cbebe4bfbf40c51ce101633ee6fc8bff3c78bdd7b9e7c7eb7d2b425f56f2810b", "ja": "焦らなくても大丈夫だよ、紬ちゃん。\n私たち、きっと、どんな役だってできるから……。", "zh": "不用着急，小䌷。\n我们不论拿到什么角色，都一定能完美诠释的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1045_049mom", "source_sha256": "88e82a02fe18ef2e15f139c56f45054b2ed300d561e5823e3d20add2acc0f82b", "ja": "そうだよ。だから、お兄ちゃん？\nこれからも、ちゃーんとお仕事取ってきてよね！", "zh": "对啊。所以说，大哥哥！\n你以后也要帮我们好好争取工作机会喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1046_p", "source_sha256": "9290de92a1821dd6859fb38b175bc314ea8beb50c45d92b54187d240f44a318e", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ。\n期待しててくれていいぞ！", "zh": "好，那当然。\n大家拭目以待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_07_1047_p", "source_sha256": "64a7448a664eb42326cb05ab0d6d408075e491674332cf4e5f2b824e510f56c5", "ja": "（この映画で、みんなの可能性はまたひとつ広がった。\n手に入れた最高の結果、次に繋げないとな……！）", "zh": "（经过这次电影拍摄，大家的可能性又进一步扩展了。\n得到了这么棒的成果，我要延续下去才行……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
